type: software
title: "Bakery Order Ledger audit trail built with Pixeltable"
abstract: "Bakery order ledger with a built-in audit trail: every edit is a Pixeltable table version, so you can read the ledger as of any version, diff two versions by order, restore a deleted order, freeze end-of-day snapshots and roll back a bad bulk edit."
